== Trivia ==
* The achievement for unlocking Tainted Azazel is "The Benighted", a possible title for the character.
** "Benighted" means "overtaken by darkness" or "in a state of ignorance", which may be linked to how Azazel is Isaac's inner demon.
*** This is further referenced through his card, {{P|XV - The Devil?}}, meaning weakness and blindness; Azazel is Isaac overtaken by his inner evil, having lost his "righteous path", shown as Azazel being beaten up like {{C|Tainted Isaac}}.
*** This weakness is also manifested in his core mechanics and way of play, needing to rely on the curse of his sneeze and projectile reflection to weaken enemies to compensate for his own lack of firepower on non-debuffed enemies.
* Like all characters that start with only soul/black hearts, Tainted Azazel's starting health is listed as "-I" on the character selection screen.
* Tainted Azazel's broken wings is a reference to how Heaven punished angels that rebelled against God by cutting their wings off and banishing them to Earth or Hell.

